on></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112191609737216729305.png/tsq9i5r6oKSgBSNwRmunZCLSQkYo1EugtYNEhLWDRIQ\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112194147422208903268.png/wxgRdDdZM17VGr1WNwHM9k1xRh-bT4FDbPFnmmzxZ5o\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112196638969856603518.png/AfUwCpeXZopkoycDlPGL2cw4e6BYi1dYc8JGB3PCRgc\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112199298289664729831.png/P88B9Z6ADWhzjq7g0ikR_yKYx21NiEFsmg-n3JoPp9w\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112201664008192905243.png/_mk0Rzn2wB3Xdj-csPaU8ecFqrGWJrUuMtfKJTLXyiU\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112204193304576528391.png/AhR-g8AJS3U8KPe93nGnqjXGXe4918FjeHKMfXhyjH0\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220602/609112206651297792037291.png/hBCB6K8KG68MjmxDu_q5-PORA7xkrpfOPHIGCTxyBgk\" alt=\"FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）\"><figcaption>FAST 4 大法則提升工作效率（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「經理人」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-13T08:17:34.392498+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":4522,"images":42,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}